":"m_main_15af_05_12","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_12","text":"That's bogus, and you know it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_13","text":"Who cares?","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_14","text":"All that matters is","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_15","text":"I'm the one who has them.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_16","text":"If I turn this into the authorities, you'll all be carted off to the Rehabilitation Center.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_17","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_17","text":"What do you want?","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_18","text":"Not much","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_19","text":"Just asking.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_20","text":"keep on keepin' on.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_21","text":"Find Vapaus","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_22","text":"You have my full support.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_23","text":"If you find Vapaus and bring it back to me","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_24","text":"I will get rid of the terror attack pl-","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_25","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_25","text":"No thanks.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_26","text":"Ah!","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_27","text":"Have you lost your mind?!","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_28","text":"These are plans for a terrorist attack.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_29","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_29","text":"I'll let everyone know that you fabricated them.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_30","text":"Ah!","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_31","text":"Easier said than done, buddy!","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_32","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_32","text":"No matter how long it takes, I will do it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_33","text":"*Sigh*","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_34","text":"My gosh.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_35","text":"So ridiculous!","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_36","text":"*Sigh*","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_37","text":"Okay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_38","text":"I see.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_39","text":"The more I step on you,","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_40","text":"the more you'll squirm. I get it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_41","text":"Let's try a different approach.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_42","text":"Don't you feel bad","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_43","text":"for your precious Nikkes?","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_44","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_44","text":"What are you talking about?","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_45","text":"Those rust buckets that you love so much","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_46","text":"will constantly be at risk of corruption.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_47","text":"Just like what happened with Marian.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_48","text":"You'll see it time and time again.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_49","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_49","text":"That's something I have to accept.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_50","text":"But there's a way you","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_51","text":"can prevent all that from happening.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_52","text":"Join me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_53","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_53","text":"Never","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_54","text":"Bring back a Vapaus sample.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_55","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_55","text":"Again with the Vapaus...","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_56","text":"I'll devote all of Missilis's manpower to replicating it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_57","text":"If we succeed in mass-producing it,","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_58","text":"we'll forever free Nikkes","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_59","text":"from the fear of corruption.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_15af_05_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_15af_05_60","text":"Forever. You and I.","jump":null}],"chat":true}